# AstroTask - Project Overview

A personal task tracker and time management application with a Go backend and Next.js frontend. Designed for tracking work across projects with session-based time tracking and a kanban-style interface.

## Quick Start

```bash
# Backend (terminal 1)
cd backend
go run cmd/server/main.go  # Runs on :8080

# Frontend (terminal 2)
cd frontend
npm run dev  # Runs on :3000

# Database
# Requires PostgreSQL running locally
createdb astrotask_db
```

