## Frontend State Management

### AuthContext
- User authentication state
- Token management with auto-refresh
- Profile and preferences (actionbar config)

### TaskContext
- All tasks for current user
- Active task (timer running)
- CRUD operations
- Kanban operations (move, reorder)
- Timer operations (start, stop, resume, sync)

### TaskDragContext
- Drag-and-drop state for kanban cards
- Drop targets (columns, done tray, delete tray)

### TimerWorkerContext
- Web Worker for timer ticks
- Shared across components that need timer state

